WEBVTT

01:31.190 --> 01:33.530
<b>I'm Wirth Madl.</b>

01:33.650 --> 01:39.620
<b>Being worthlessly weak
is absolutely inexcusable. Got that?</b>

01:40.030 --> 01:40.990
<b>Graviole.</b>

01:43.330 --> 01:46.120
<b>I have no time to be your playmate.</b>

01:56.220 --> 01:59.890
<b>Gravity magic, huh? What a surprise.</b>

02:02.560 --> 02:05.890
<b>This might be fun after all.</b>

02:06.770 --> 02:07.980
<b>Right?</b>

02:09.400 --> 02:10.400
<b>Graviole.</b>

02:18.070 --> 02:19.780
<b>Useless, so useless!</b>

02:21.990 --> 02:23.490
<b><i>Mud clones.</i></b>

02:23.620 --> 02:26.830
<b><i>So I have to crush the real one.</i></b>

02:27.410 --> 02:29.370
<b><i>That'll make things quick.</i></b>

02:29.370 --> 02:30.960
<b><i>I'll attack the whole field.</i></b>

02:31.380 --> 02:32.590
<b>Graviole.</b>

02:37.840 --> 02:39.380
<b>Too bad.</b>

02:40.050 --> 02:41.140
<b>Burst!</b>

02:43.470 --> 02:46.270
<b><i>My legs are stuck. When did he...</i></b>

02:52.440 --> 02:55.570
<b>The Crown family is renowned
for their gravity magic.</b>

02:55.570 --> 02:58.150
<b>You come from a good bloodline.</b>

02:58.240 --> 02:59.950
<b>Your talent is wasted.</b>

03:00.860 --> 03:04.070
<b>Perfect. You should join Magia Lupus.</b>

03:04.280 --> 03:07.240
<b>Looks like your skills aren't too bad.</b>

03:07.330 --> 03:10.620
<b>Bet you'd fit in nicely in our lower ranks.</b>

03:10.710 --> 03:14.340
<b>And more than anything,
I feel sorry for you.</b>

03:14.340 --> 03:18.300
<b>A magic user of your talents belongs
in an environment where you can flourish.</b>

03:19.010 --> 03:22.720
<b>Your growth depends on those around you.</b>

03:22.720 --> 03:26.140
<b>Surround yourself with garbage
and you'll undoubtedly start to reek.</b>

03:26.640 --> 03:28.310
<b>Meaning?</b>

03:28.350 --> 03:31.520
<b>C'mon! You really need me
to spell it out for you?</b>

03:32.140 --> 03:37.530
<b>Those Adlers are trash.
You'll rot too if you stay with them.</b>

03:38.320 --> 03:43.660
<b>People are supposed to be surrounded
by their equals.</b>

03:43.860 --> 03:47.790
<b>Hang around with the dregs
and you just sink to their level.</b>

03:48.700 --> 03:52.540
<b>Being a Magia Lupus is amazing.
We all have so much talent!</b>

03:53.250 --> 03:57.590
<b>We also get excellent education,
tools, potions...</b>

03:57.590 --> 04:01.050
<b>Our environment is designed
to bring out the best magic in us.</b>

04:02.090 --> 04:04.300
<b>An environment to become stronger...</b>

04:05.010 --> 04:11.560
<b>The strength of my conviction is not
superficial enough for the environment to matter.</b>

04:14.140 --> 04:16.230
<b>Was that too difficult to grasp?</b>

04:16.360 --> 04:18.400
<b>From my point of view,</b>

04:18.520 --> 04:20.820
<b>you are second-rate.</b>

04:23.700 --> 04:26.570
<b>Second rate? Is that so?</b>

04:27.160 --> 04:29.830
<b>Do you understand what you're saying?</b>

04:31.250 --> 04:32.330
<b>Graviole.</b>

04:34.830 --> 04:37.590
<b><i>He shifted gravity sideways to a wall.</i></b>

04:41.380 --> 04:43.970
<b><i>But it won't make a difference.</i></b>

04:44.300 --> 04:50.220
<b><i>I cushion walls and floors with
a muddy environment to absorb shocks.</i></b>

04:50.930 --> 04:55.100
<b><i>Gravity magic needs a place
to slam your opponent into.</i></b>

04:55.850 --> 04:59.770
<b><i>As long as he doesn't figure
this trick out, I'm impervi...</i></b>

05:02.110 --> 05:07.110
<b><i>He's shooting rubble created earlier
into the mud using gravity.</i></b>

05:12.830 --> 05:18.790
<b><i>Did this kid already realize
what my anti-gravity trick is?</i></b>

05:19.590 --> 05:22.880
<b>You said people become stronger
with a better environment.</b>

05:23.380 --> 05:24.050
<b>Yeah?</b>

05:24.050 --> 05:30.890
<b>Based on your logic, it appears
my environment is the superior one.</b>

05:32.890 --> 05:34.390
<b><i>I am strong.</i></b>

05:35.480 --> 05:37.980
<b><i>I was born with two marks.</i></b>

05:38.520 --> 05:42.150
<b><i>I have a capacity for magic
beyond your average flunky.</i></b>

05:42.940 --> 05:46.900
<b><i>I've been at Easton since middle school.</i></b>

05:46.990 --> 05:49.910
<b><i>My joining the Magia Lupus was inevitable.</i></b>

05:50.240 --> 05:54.580
<b><i>There, I received an education
reserved for Lang's best.</i></b>

05:55.960 --> 05:59.080
<b><i>That's right. Of course I'm strong.</i></b>

05:59.250 --> 06:01.500
<b><i>After all that, there's no way I couldn't be.</i></b>

06:01.880 --> 06:05.380
<b><i>So there's no way I could be weak.</i></b>

06:06.220 --> 06:08.970
<b>Pretty cocky of you, first-year.</b>

06:09.640 --> 06:11.680
<b>You think you've beaten me?</b>

06:14.060 --> 06:18.440
<b>This is concentrated magical essence,
extracted from other students.</b>

06:19.940 --> 06:24.690
<b>We Magia Lupus are awarded this essence.</b>

06:25.480 --> 06:27.440
<b>We're special!</b>

06:30.780 --> 06:33.200
<b><i>His magic power further spiked.</i></b>

06:36.000 --> 06:38.870
<b>Now I'll prove to you...</b>

06:39.540 --> 06:42.210
<b>which of us is right.</b>

06:44.090 --> 06:46.210
<b>Mudoros Secondth!</b>

07:00.560 --> 07:02.610
<b>Mudoro Devilus!</b>

07:05.610 --> 07:08.070
<b>All magic have tiers.</b>

07:08.530 --> 07:14.700
<b>Basic magic, personal magic.
Then the more advanced conditional magic.</b>

07:14.990 --> 07:20.210
<b>But Secondth is different
from magic used by single-liners.</b>

07:20.920 --> 07:26.090
<b>It's higher-tier magic that only certain
double-liners are allowed to cast.</b>

07:26.420 --> 07:31.260
<b>That's right.
Only the few worthy can use it.</b>

07:31.380 --> 07:32.800
<b><i>You must understand, Wirth.</i></b>

07:33.220 --> 07:36.930
<b><i>It's your achievements
that determine your worth.</i></b>

07:36.930 --> 07:39.270
<b><i>I will be worthy.</i></b>

07:39.350 --> 07:45.610
<b><i>And in this world, magic means everything.
Your magic determines your worth.</i></b>

07:45.610 --> 07:47.570
<b><i>I will be worthy.</i></b>

07:48.190 --> 07:51.450
<b><i>Those with an aptitude
for magic have worth.</i></b>

07:51.450 --> 07:54.870
<b><i>Those without it are worthless.</i></b>

07:55.870 --> 07:56.830
<b><i>You're wrong.</i></b>

07:57.410 --> 07:59.660
<b><i>I'm more than my aptitude.</i></b>

07:59.750 --> 08:02.830
<b><i>I earned the position
that I am standing in now.</i></b>

08:02.960 --> 08:05.330
<b><i>I am worthy.</i></b>

08:06.000 --> 08:10.760
<b>Because you hang out
with worthless flunkies, this magic</b>

08:10.760 --> 08:13.800
<b>is at a level you'll never achieve!</b>

08:19.060 --> 08:24.770
<b>You called them flunkies, but you really
don't understand anything, do you?</b>

08:26.520 --> 08:30.480
<b>He reminded me of something important.</b>

08:31.190 --> 08:36.200
<b><i>I'm too clumsy to make
rational decisions about everything.</i></b>

08:36.950 --> 08:42.250
<b>So the only one allowed
to insult them as flunkies is me.</b>

08:43.330 --> 08:45.710
<b>Graviole Secondth.</b>

08:53.970 --> 08:55.550
<b>Torture Pole!</b>

09:00.260 --> 09:04.140
<b><i>Mudoro Devilus's movement...
So these pillars...</i></b>

09:04.140 --> 09:05.310
<b>That's right.</b>

09:06.020 --> 09:12.740
<b>These pillars exert
strong gravitational pulls toward them.</b>

09:13.280 --> 09:19.240
<b>And that monster surrounded by the pillars
will be pulled by gravity from all directions</b>

09:20.120 --> 09:21.240
<b>and ripped apart.</b>

09:26.460 --> 09:29.500
<b><i>My strongest spell was defeated?</i></b>

09:31.750 --> 09:34.220
<b><i>Are you saying I was defeated?</i></b>

09:34.840 --> 09:35.760
<b><i>But I...</i></b>

09:36.880 --> 09:39.430
<b>Acknowledged by the top of your dorm?</b>

09:40.220 --> 09:42.850
<b>You're striving to be the top at Easton.</b>

09:43.720 --> 09:47.770
<b>Entering the Bureau alone will not
make you worthy as my creation.</b>

09:48.520 --> 09:53.610
<b>Do you understand?
You are still worthless to me.</b>

09:55.240 --> 09:59.070
<b>When will you finally show me
that you are worth something?</b>

10:03.540 --> 10:05.450
<b><i>I'm worthless.</i></b>

10:07.750 --> 10:10.500
<b>This is yours, right? It was on the ground.</b>

10:11.460 --> 10:15.260
<b>That reference text
looks ragged from lots of use.</b>

10:15.800 --> 10:18.590
<b>What do you think gives someone worth?</b>

10:20.300 --> 10:25.640
<b>My parents measured worth by position
and social standing more than anything.</b>

10:26.890 --> 10:31.810
<b>Based on your words and actions,
you and I were probably raised similarly.</b>

10:32.270 --> 10:36.280
<b><i>When I grow up, I want to be a singer!</i></b>

10:38.110 --> 10:44.080
<b>In that environment, it feels like
your worth is judged by aptitude and standing.</b>

10:44.580 --> 10:46.370
<b>But I disagree with that.</b>

10:46.660 --> 10:50.080
<b><i>Hey! You're thinking
I totally can't do it, aren't you?</i></b>

10:50.330 --> 10:54.840
<b><i>But I think it's important
that I decided to try my best!</i></b>

10:57.210 --> 11:00.380
<b>I don't like the way you talk or act.</b>

11:01.590 --> 11:04.390
<b>But I respect all the effort you've put in.</b>

11:10.900 --> 11:12.190
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

11:12.860 --> 11:18.240
<b><i>It's not like I wanted to become
a worthy person. The truth is...</i></b>

11:20.070 --> 11:21.410
<b>Stupid punk.</b>

11:22.950 --> 11:26.620
<b>I didn't ask for your respect.</b>

11:54.690 --> 11:58.900
<b>You can't win. Not against me.</b>

11:59.610 --> 12:01.030
<b>Acceleraise.</b>

12:12.500 --> 12:16.250
<b>Do you understand now?
We're incomparable.</b>

12:16.750 --> 12:20.340
<b>You can continue to challenge me,
knowing that.</b>

12:20.840 --> 12:23.340
<b>But I will not go easy on you.</b>

12:23.680 --> 12:24.220
<b>Even if—</b>

12:24.220 --> 12:25.340
<b>It doesn't matter.</b>

12:26.720 --> 12:30.100
<b>None of that matters. None of it.</b>

12:31.520 --> 12:35.190
<b>"Live in peace with your family."
Is that right?</b>

12:37.360 --> 12:39.480
<b>How revolting.</b>

12:40.730 --> 12:44.570
<b>Your situation is similar to mine,
but those ideas...</b>

12:44.950 --> 12:47.870
<b>You must've been blessed
with whoever was around you.</b>

12:49.080 --> 12:50.580
<b>Fine then.</b>

12:50.580 --> 12:54.250
<b>Please show me your best.</b>

12:55.830 --> 12:58.670
<b>This device drains magic power.</b>

12:59.210 --> 13:03.130
<b>In about 30 minutes,
your friend will lose her magic power.</b>

13:03.470 --> 13:07.340
<b>She'll lose her mark
and the ability to use magic forever.</b>

13:08.550 --> 13:09.850
<b>What do you think?</b>

13:10.180 --> 13:13.560
<b>Now your friend will be just like you.</b>

13:14.310 --> 13:15.940
<b>Doesn't that make you happy?</b>

13:17.610 --> 13:21.650
<b>If you're seriously saying that,
then that mask</b>

13:22.190 --> 13:24.150
<b>will be coming off in pieces.</b>

13:24.740 --> 13:26.990
<b>Quite obstinate.</b>

13:27.070 --> 13:28.370
<b>Very well.</b>

13:29.030 --> 13:30.620
<b>Then I will not hold back.</b>

13:31.740 --> 13:33.160
<b>Acceleraise Sphere.</b>

13:36.710 --> 13:39.920
<b>Anyone can spout high-minded ideals.</b>

13:40.590 --> 13:43.130
<b>But in the end, you're all talk.</b>

13:55.230 --> 13:59.440
<b>Ultimately, you can't save anyone.</b>

14:01.320 --> 14:03.190
<b>I can't pull out my sword.</b>

14:04.740 --> 14:06.110
<b>Caught you.</b>

14:06.610 --> 14:08.740
<b><i>Is he clenching his abdominal muscles?</i></b>

14:09.950 --> 14:12.910
<b>My abs are pretty toned.</b>

14:13.830 --> 14:14.870
<b>Right!?</b>

14:28.010 --> 14:31.300
<b>That red eye. Is it...</b>

14:34.640 --> 14:36.180
<b>Bloodshot?</b>

14:39.350 --> 14:42.230
<b>You don't know what this eye means?</b>

14:42.690 --> 14:43.650
<b>Nope.</b>

14:44.780 --> 14:46.110
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:46.110 --> 14:47.990
<b>Don't apologize.</b>

14:48.110 --> 14:49.070
<b>Okay.</b>

14:50.280 --> 14:54.080
<b>This eye is called "Evil Eye."</b>

14:55.120 --> 14:59.040
<b>The Eye of the Devil temporarily disables
the magic of all who fall under its gaze.</b>

15:00.250 --> 15:06.840
<b>Magic is everything in this world.
Thus, I am a pariah. A target of scorn.</b>

15:07.760 --> 15:13.470
<b>SLUMP...</b>

15:08.340 --> 15:13.470
<b>I feel kinda bad now.
You can't use that eye on me at all.</b>

15:15.600 --> 15:16.720
<b>It's fine.</b>

15:17.560 --> 15:21.440
<b>I'm the natural enemy of all magic users.</b>

15:21.850 --> 15:25.400
<b>I've been feared and despised my whole life.</b>

15:26.280 --> 15:29.700
<b>By everyone. Even my parents.</b>

15:30.360 --> 15:35.910
<b>Though, someone as seemingly blessed as you
probably can't understand.</b>

15:37.950 --> 15:42.000
<b>There are people in this world
who should have never been born.</b>

15:45.960 --> 15:48.380
<b>Acceleraise Secondth.</b>

15:55.890 --> 15:57.520
<b>Force Field.</b>

16:02.190 --> 16:03.440
<b>An arro...</b>

16:10.280 --> 16:14.620
<b>Surprised by your lack of speed?</b>

16:15.280 --> 16:19.500
<b>This field decreases the speed
of everyone else within it...</b>

16:19.750 --> 16:23.080
<b>and grants that speed to me.</b>

16:31.630 --> 16:35.050
<b>You won't get me a second time.
This is truly the end.</b>

16:42.100 --> 16:43.230
<b><i>What is he...</i></b>

16:49.480 --> 16:51.990
<b><i>So much power, even when slowed...</i></b>

16:52.360 --> 16:54.410
<b><i>But at that level, my attacks...</i></b>

17:02.870 --> 17:03.960
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

17:04.370 --> 17:09.250
<b><i>He split the floor
to narrow down my movement route.</i></b>

17:10.670 --> 17:12.420
<b><i>I need to pull back
and regain my balance...</i></b>

17:13.420 --> 17:14.430
<b><i>My foot.</i></b>

17:18.850 --> 17:21.560
<b>Got you... a second time.</b>

17:22.060 --> 17:23.430
<b>Full Muscles Magic.</b>

17:25.100 --> 17:26.690
<b>Hurricane Rush.</b>

17:35.990 --> 17:38.120
<b><i>My Secondth spell</i></b>

17:38.120 --> 17:41.080
<b><i>was shattered by ridiculous violence?</i></b>

17:46.080 --> 17:47.290
<b>Glutes!</b>

17:48.330 --> 17:50.880
<b><i>We're on entirely different levels.</i></b>

17:53.510 --> 17:55.630
<b><i>If I lose here, I...</i></b>

17:56.930 --> 17:59.050
<b><i>My reason for living will...</i></b>

18:00.350 --> 18:01.180
<b>Acceleraise!</b>

18:11.770 --> 18:12.940
<b>Forearm!</b>

18:17.360 --> 18:18.820
<b>Quadriceps!</b>

18:21.030 --> 18:22.160
<b>Pectorals!</b>

18:24.790 --> 18:26.160
<b>Iliopsoas!</b>

18:35.210 --> 18:38.090
<b>Erector Spinae.</b>

18:51.310 --> 18:53.610
<b>I cannot help but think.</b>

18:54.280 --> 18:57.190
<b>What if I'd been born normal?</b>

18:59.530 --> 19:04.490
<b>I was still a young child
when my eye manifested.</b>

19:05.580 --> 19:08.790
<b>My parents were shocked, of course.</b>

19:09.710 --> 19:16.170
<b>I was an affront to God's gift of magic.
The Eye of the Devil.</b>

19:18.760 --> 19:25.100
<b>Just like the markless children they cull,
my existence was aberrant to this world.</b>

19:25.970 --> 19:31.900
<b>My family locked me in a cell in the basement
so people wouldn't know I existed.</b>

19:32.770 --> 19:36.730
<b>At set times,
food appeared right outside my cell.</b>

19:36.940 --> 19:39.780
<b>That was my life for a while,
until one day...</b>

19:41.780 --> 19:44.830
<b>My parents tried to kill me.</b>

19:45.870 --> 19:51.330
<b>They must have been at their wits' end
for having a child like me.</b>

19:54.710 --> 19:57.340
<b>I had come to a realization.</b>

19:58.880 --> 20:02.180
<b>That I never should have been born.</b>

20:05.300 --> 20:08.600
<b>However, Lord Abel needed me.</b>

20:09.770 --> 20:13.850
<b>Even if it was simply to be a useful tool.</b>

20:17.110 --> 20:20.690
<b>I couldn't even meet that expectation.</b>

20:21.570 --> 20:26.910
<b>Once again, I'm back
to being unwanted by anyone.</b>

20:27.950 --> 20:32.460
<b>You're probably right
about me being blessed.</b>

20:32.830 --> 20:35.580
<b>I can't even begin
to put myself in your place.</b>

20:36.420 --> 20:40.090
<b>But we could become friends, then...</b>

20:41.130 --> 20:44.550
<b>You're an amenable one, aren't you?</b>

20:44.720 --> 20:46.680
<b>I honestly envy you.</b>

20:47.890 --> 20:49.470
<b>But that's impossible.</b>

20:49.890 --> 20:54.060
<b>As long as I have this eye,
your attitude toward me will shift someday, too.</b>

20:55.020 --> 20:59.980
<b>But for your kindness,
let me advise you.</b>

21:00.690 --> 21:03.400
<b>Please do not progress any further.</b>

21:04.070 --> 21:06.450
<b>You cannot defeat Lord Abel.</b>

21:09.120 --> 21:12.870
<b>What you saw when you faced him
was nowhere near his true powers.</b>

21:13.250 --> 21:15.080
<b>Even if you've retained
some stamina in this victory—</b>

21:15.080 --> 21:17.080
<b>Thank you for warning me.</b>

21:17.840 --> 21:22.210
<b>But I have to give him
a good walloping. So, you know.</b>

21:23.010 --> 21:26.180
<b>Oh, and I won't change my mind.</b>

21:27.340 --> 21:30.970
<b>No matter how much
the world loathes your eye.</b>

21:31.770 --> 21:35.390
<b>No matter what others say
about you because of it.</b>

21:36.190 --> 21:39.480
<b>My attitude toward you won't change.</b>

21:42.780 --> 21:47.990
<b>That's how Pops raised me.
Me, who can't use magic.</b>

21:50.280 --> 21:52.870
<b>We should eat cream puffs
together next time.</b>

21:53.660 --> 21:54.710
<b>Later.</b>

22:00.880 --> 22:02.550
<b>What a strange guy.</b>

23:35.220 --> 23:39.940
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MASH BURNEDEAD AND THE DIVINE VISIONARY</b>
